.SS "int daemon_signal_fd (void)"
.PP
Return the file descriptor the daemon should select() on for reading.
.PP
Whenever the descriptor is ready you should call \fBdaemon_signal_next()\fP to get the next signal queued. 
.PP
\fBReturns: \fP
.in +1c
The file descriptor or negative on failure 
